  "body": "Our overseas owners are serious and want this sold!\r\n\r\nCome home on a afternoon and relax and indulge in the warm spa. When you enter this magnificent Orewa home you won't be disappointed! It's crisp modern decor will impress and offers ample space for a large family. Positioned to soak up the everchanging estuary views. Enjoy entertaining friends and family in the covered outdoor area all year round. The large open plan living space offers a magnificent gourmet cook's kitchen with quality appliances. The home comes complete with a master builders guarantee. Double garage plus room for a caravan or a boat. \r\nThere is plenty of space for the whole family providing five double bedrooms and three bathrooms. On the lower level is the fifth bedroom with its very own bathroom, walk-in wardrobe and patio ideal for a teenager or a flat mate. \r\n\r\nYou have the estuary walks right across the road for those keen to indulge in an easy run or bike into Orewa. \r\n\r\nPhone Cindy Today to make an appointment to View!",
